":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月お誕生日の方！\nこのブログに6月誕生日！ってコメントお願いします！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、3月4月生まれの方で\n名前を載せられていなかった方です！\nごめんね(ノ_・。)\nお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月のお誕生日会は今まで通り画像でお祝いしたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、7月でこのお誕生日会が\n丸2年たって3年目になるんですが、\nやり方を変えようかな～と思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ、考えてるんだけど\nまとまらないのでみなさんの意見が欲しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなのがいい！\nこれをやってほしい！\nなどあったら、コメントにお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"ty