xt":"今まで握手会は自分の好きな洋服ばっかり着てたから、いろいろ挑戦してみたいな～٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら、皆さんと一緒にもっと楽しい時間過ごせるかな(｡・・｡)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、楽しいけど度が過ぎて\n腕とか引きちぎったらごめんね(｡-∀-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冗談だけどね(｡>ω<｡)♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの威嚇顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアPVは未央奈と(｡>ω<｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またペアPVの話はするけど、\n絶対握手会であの歌、歌って！っていう人いるよね？(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音痴だけど\n別に練習しないしっ(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/07/09/5305632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、ブログ書きます٩(๑`^´๑)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー(｡ρω-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin